* LT3094 Negative LDO delivering -5V from -7V input

* Input Voltage Source
V1 IN 0 -7

* Load Resistor (10mA load at -5V)
Rload OUT 0 500

* LT3094 LDO Subcircuit
* Standard LTspice Pin Order: IN EN_UVLO PGFB PG ILIM SET VIOC GND OUT
X1 IN 0 IN IN IN SET IN 0 OUT LT3094

* SET Pin Programming
* The LT3094 features a precision 100uA current source flowing from GND through Rset.
* VOUT = -100uA * Rset -> For -5V output, Rset = 50k
Rset SET 0 50k
Cset SET 0 10n

* Input and Output Capacitors (with small ESR for simulation stability)
Cin IN 0 10u Rser=0.01
Cout OUT 0 10u Rser=0.01

* Transient analysis to allow the LDO to settle to its DC operating point
.tran 20m

.end
